===== en | 160x60 | trait blurb =====
Mew  level 60

  elusive
    Always carries evasive.

  composure
    Refuses 50% of any stun aimed at it.
    Refuses 50% of any taunting aimed at it.

  swiftness
    Always carries quickened.

  endurance
    Always carries toughened.

  contagion
    Its attacks also inflict weaken, 25% of the time.

  blood_thirst
    Everything it does takes back 25% of the damage dealt.

  last_gasp
    Everything it does takes back 40% of the damage dealt.
    In force only at or below 40% health.
